H_0012> is\nsurjective and flat, then we say <MATH_0013> descends through\nflat surjective base changes. If <MATH_0014> is preserved under\nflat base changes and descends through flat surjective base changes,\nthen we say <MATH_0015> is flat local on the target.\nCompare with the discussion in\nSection <REF_0001>.\nThis turns out to be a very important notion which\nwe formalize in the following definition.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8323c2ee4a2f44cc75c6256359bb8ca447ad8f1a4315eb582ba252fb1b6b4e7f", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:02KN:paragraph/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:02KN:section_title/0001", "hash": "sha256:9f2513727569e4eb6e5e33113615a892bc53b0f7fc48692dc04b24f7d12ed023", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 198146, "byte_start": 198045, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:d1f56f4b0da7564f59f4249a7616c997003d96566599366d9eab9967de446423", "line_end": 5283, "line_start": 5282}, "owner_tag": "02KN", "parent_tag": "02KN", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "02KN", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{section-descending-properties-morphisms}", "TEXTCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTOPEN_0001": "\\section{"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4f0150807f181415e70ccd7478300d58a120e83fbc414cdb41cadf9b45096005", "source_text": "<TEXTOPEN_0001>Properties of morphisms local on the target<TEXTCLOSE_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:26eebebc9dab7a035f704d7930d6ce1527cf16ee614747f7256c54383eaadc6e", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:02KN:section_title/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:02KO:definition/0001", "hash